00:0000051A 51C9FFF6        	   722:     DBF     D1,.Loop
00:0000051E 4E75            	   723:     RTS
                            	   724: 
                            	   725: ; Lê byte hexadecimal (2 caracteres ASCII)
                            	   726: UART_ReadByte:
